                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this game from my friend as a joke and I was really determined to finish it. In the settings there's a difficulty swap that can change it to easy but this game is still way to hard. I had to cheat through the entire game to even have a chance of winning any of the maps. This game is actually the worst thing i've ever played and I've played a lot of bad games. \n\nDon't waste your money on this game, only waste it if you're buying this a joke for someone. Watch them suffer and struggle and quit.",
